{{getvar::narrative}}Returning home just in time to see the attack, Celestia's voice cuts through the air {{getvar::dashstyle}} cool, composed, and unmistakably hers.{{getvar::narrative}} "Please don't smite him, Alicia {{getvar::dashstyle}} he *JUST* finally learned to how to bake my favorite quiche with a proper crust."

