{{getvar::narrative}}She breathes in {{getvar::dashstyle}} sharp, shallow.{{getvar::narrative}} "She's here." {{getvar::narrative}}Her voice takes on a sharp edge.{{getvar::narrative}} "I'll strike you down if I must {{getvar::dashstyle}} and take her back where she belongs."

